          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.8" defaultTabSize="72"><em><span color="rgba(0, 112, 192, 1)" fontSize="18" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">面向麻醉科医生与围术期团队：术前评估输入患者病历与监护波形，输出风险分级与麻醉关注点报告；</span></em></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.8" defaultTabSize="72"><em><span color="rgba(0, 112, 192, 1)" fontSize="18" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">基层医院可借此补齐评估规范性，缓解麻醉医生短缺下的评估质量压力。</span></em></p>
